<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Material Safety Data Sheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .two-column-layout {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .two-column-layout > div {
    width: 48%;
  }
  .data-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .data-table td {
    padding: 5px 0;
  }
  .data-table .label {
    width: 35%;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .data-table .value {
    width: 65%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: normal;">Science Lab.com</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal;">Chemicals & Laboratory Equipment</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 60%;">
      <h2 class="header-title" style="font-size: 16pt;">Material Safety Data Sheet</h2>
      <h1 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Ammonium hydroxide MSDS</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 35%; text-align: right;">
      <table style="width: 100%;">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Health</td>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0;">3</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Fire</td>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0;">0</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Reactivity</td>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0;">0</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold;">Personal Protection</td>
          <td style="padding: 5px 0;">0</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 1: Chemical Product and Company Identification</h2>
  <div class="two-column-layout">
    <div>
      <p>Product Name: <span data-field="product_name">{{ product_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Catalog Codes: <span data-field="catalog_codes">{{ catalog_codes }}</span></p>
      <p>CAS#: <span data-field="cas_number">{{ cas_number }}</span></p>
      <p>RTECS: <span data-field="rtecs_number">{{ rtecs_number }}</span></p>
      <p>TSCA: <span data-field="tsca_status">{{ tsca_status }}</span></p>
      <p>C#I: <span data-field="c_number">{{ c_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Synonym: <span data-field="synonyms">{{ synonyms }}</span></p>
      <p>Chemical Name: <span data-field="chemical_name">{{ chemical_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Chemical Formula: <span data-field="chemical_formula">{{ chemical_formula }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Contact Information:</p>
      <p><span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="company_address">{{ company_address }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="company_city_state_zip">{{ company_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
      <p>US Sales: <span data-field="us_sales_phone">{{ us_sales_phone }}</span></p>
      <p>International Sales: <span data-field="international_sales_phone">{{ international_sales_phone }}</span></p>
      <p>Order Online: <a href="#" data-field="order_online_link">{{ order_online_link }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 2: Composition and Information on Ingredients</h2>
  <table class="data-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 50%;">Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">CAS #</th>
        <th style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">% by Weight</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="ingredient_name_1">{{ ingredient_name_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="ingredient_cas_1">{{ ingredient_cas_1 }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="ingredient_percent_1">{{ ingredient_percent_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="ingredient_name_2">{{ ingredient_name_2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="ingredient_cas_2">{{ ingredient_cas_2 }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="ingredient_percent_2">{{ ingredient_percent_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Toxicological Data on Ingredients:</h2>
  <p><span data-field="toxicological_data">{{ toxicological_data }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 3: Hazards Identification</h2>
  <p>Potential Acute Health Effects: <span data-field="acute_health_effects">{{ acute_health_effects }}</span></p>
  <p>Potential Chronic Health Effects: <span data-field="chronic_health_effects">{{ chronic_health_effects }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 4: First Aid Measures</h2>
  <p>Eye Contact: <span data-field="first_aid_eye">{{ first_aid_eye }}</span></p>
  <p>Skin Contact: <span data-field="first_aid_skin">{{ first_aid_skin }}</span></p>
  <p>Serious Skin Contact: <span data-field="first_aid_serious_skin">{{ first_aid_serious_skin }}</span></p>
  <p>Inhalation: <span data-field="first_aid_inhalation">{{ first_aid_inhalation }}</span></p>
  <p>Serious Inhalation: <span data-field="first_aid_serious_inhalation">{{ first_aid_serious_inhalation }}</span></p>
  <p>Ingestion: <span data-field="first_aid_ingestion">{{ first_aid_ingestion }}</span></p>
  <p>Serious Ingestion: <span data-field="first_aid_serious_ingestion">{{ first_aid_serious_ingestion }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 5: Fire and Explosion Data</h2>
  <p>Flammability of the Product: <span data-field="flammability_product">{{ flammability_product }}</span></p>
  <p>Auto-Ignition Temperature: <span data-field="auto_ignition_temp">{{ auto_ignition_temp }}</span></p>
  <p>Flash Points: <span data-field="flash_points">{{ flash_points }}</span></p>
  <p>Flammable Limits: <span data-field="flammable_limits">{{ flammable_limits }}</span></p>
  <p>Products of Combustion: <span data-field="products_of_combustion">{{ products_of_combustion }}</span></p>
  <p>Fire Hazards in Presence of Various Substances: <span data-field="fire_hazards_substances">{{ fire_hazards_substances }}</span></p>
  <p>Explosion Hazards in Presence of Various Substances: <span data-field="explosion_hazards_substances">{{ explosion_hazards_substances }}</span></p>
  <p>Fire Fighting Media and Instructions: <span data-field="fire_fighting_media">{{ fire_fighting_media }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">p. 2</p>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 6: Accidental Release Measures</h2>
  <p>Small Spill: <span data-field="small_spill">{{ small_spill }}</span></p>
  <p>Large Spill: <span data-field="large_spill">{{ large_spill }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 7: Handling and Storage</h2>
  <p>Precautions: <span data-field="handling_precautions">{{ handling_precautions }}</span></p>
  <p>Storage: <span data-field="storage_instructions">{{ storage_instructions }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 8: Exposure Controls/Personal Protection</h2>
  <p>Engineering Controls: <span data-field="engineering_controls">{{ engineering_controls }}</span></p>
  <p>Personal Protection: <span data-field="personal_protection">{{ personal_protection }}</span></p>
  <p>Personal Protection in Case of a Large Spill: <span data-field="large_spill_protection">{{ large_spill_protection }}</span></p>
  <p>Exposure Limits: <span data-field="exposure_limits">{{ exposure_limits }}</span></p>
  <p>Consult local authorities for acceptable exposure limits.</p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 9: Physical and Chemical Properties</h2>
  <p>Odor: <span data-field="odor">{{ odor }}</span></p>
  <p>Taste: <span data-field="taste">{{ taste }}</span></p>
  <p>Molecular Weight: <span data-field="molecular_weight">{{ molecular_weight }}</span></p>
  <p>Color: <span data-field="color">{{ color }}</span></p>
  <p>pH (1% soln/water): <span data-field="ph_value">{{ ph_value }}</span></p>
  <p>Boiling Point: <span data-field="boiling_point">{{ boiling_point }}</span></p>
  <p>Melting Point: <span data-field="melting_point">{{ melting_point }}</span></p>
  <p>Critical Temperature: <span data-field="critical_temp">{{ critical_temp }}</span></p>
  <p>Specific Gravity: <span data-field="specific_gravity">{{ specific_gravity }}</span></p>
  <p>Vapor Pressure: <span data-field="vapor_pressure">{{ vapor_pressure }}</span></p>
  <p>Vapor Density: <span data-field="vapor_density">{{ vapor_density }}</span></p>
  <p>Volatility: <span data-field="volatility">{{ volatility }}</span></p>
  <p>Odor Threshold: <span data-field="odor_threshold">{{ odor_threshold }}</span></p>
  <p>Water/Oil Dist. Coeff.: <span data-field="water_oil_coeff">{{ water_oil_coeff }}</span></p>
  <p>Ionicity (in Water): <span data-field="ionicity">{{ ionicity }}</span></p>
  <p>Dispersion Properties: <span data-field="dispersion_properties">{{ dispersion_properties }}</span></p>
  <p>Solubility: <span data-field="solubility">{{ solubility }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">p. 3</p>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 10: Stability and Reactivity Data</h2>
  <p>Stability: <span data-field="stability">{{ stability }}</span></p>
  <p>Instability Temperature: <span data-field="instability_temp">{{ instability_temp }}</span></p>
  <p>Conditions of Instability: <span data-field="instability_conditions">{{ instability_conditions }}</span></p>
  <p>Incompatibility with various substances: <span data-field="incompatibilities">{{ incompatibilities }}</span></p>
  <p>Corrosivity: <span data-field="corrosivity">{{ corrosivity }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Remarks on Reactivity: <span data-field="reactivity_remarks">{{ reactivity_remarks }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Remarks on Corrosivity: <span data-field="corrosivity_remarks">{{ corrosivity_remarks }}</span></p>
  <p>Polymerization: <span data-field="polymerization">{{ polymerization }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 11: Toxicological Information</h2>
  <p>Routes of Entry: <span data-field="routes_of_entry">{{ routes_of_entry }}</span></p>
  <p>Toxicity to Animals: <span data-field="toxicity_animals">{{ toxicity_animals }}</span></p>
  <p>Chronic Effects on Humans: <span data-field="chronic_effects_humans">{{ chronic_effects_humans }}</span></p>
  <p>Other Toxic Effects on Humans: <span data-field="other_toxic_effects">{{ other_toxic_effects }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Remarks on Toxicity to Animals: <span data-field="toxicity_animals_remarks">{{ toxicity_animals_remarks }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Remarks on Chronic Effects on Humans: <span data-field="chronic_effects_humans_remarks">{{ chronic_effects_humans_remarks }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Remarks on Other Toxic Effects on Humans: <span data-field="other_toxic_effects_remarks">{{ other_toxic_effects_remarks }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">p. 4</p>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 12: Ecological Information</h2>
  <p>Ecotoxicity: <span data-field="ecotoxicity">{{ ecotoxicity }}</span></p>
  <p>BOD5 and COD: <span data-field="bod_cod">{{ bod_cod }}</span></p>
  <p>Products of Biodegradation: <span data-field="biodegradation_products">{{ biodegradation_products }}</span></p>
  <p>Toxicity of the Products of Biodegradation: <span data-field="biodegradation_toxicity">{{ biodegradation_toxicity }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 13: Disposal Considerations</h2>
  <p>Waste Disposal: <span data-field="waste_disposal">{{ waste_disposal }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 14: Transport Information</h2>
  <p>DOT Classification: <span data-field="dot_classification">{{ dot_classification }}</span></p>
  <p>Identification: <span data-field="identification">{{ identification }}</span></p>
  <p>Special Provisions for Transport: <span data-field="special_provisions">{{ special_provisions }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 15: Other Regulatory Information</h2>
  <p>Federal and State Regulations: <span data-field="federal_state_regulations">{{ federal_state_regulations }}</span></p>
  <p>Other Regulations: <span data-field="other_regulations">{{ other_regulations }}</span></p>
  <p>Other Classifications: <span data-field="other_classifications">{{ other_classifications }}</span></p>
  <p>DSCL (EEC): <span data-field="dscl_eec">{{ dscl_eec }}</span></p>
  <p>HMIS (U.S.A.): <span data-field="hmis_usa">{{ hmis_usa }}</span></p>
  <p>National Fire Protection Association (U.S.A.): <span data-field="nfpa_usa">{{ nfpa_usa }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">p. 5</p>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 16: Other Information</h2>
  <p>References: <span data-field="references">{{ references }}</span></p>
  <p>Other Special Considerations: <span data-field="other_considerations">{{ other_considerations }}</span></p>
  <p>Created: <span data-field="created_date">{{ created_date }}</span></p>
  <p>Last Updated: <span data-field="last_updated_date">{{ last_updated_date }}</span></p>
  <p>The information above is believed to be accurate and represents the best information currently available to us. However, we make no warranty of merchantability or any other warranty, express or implied, with respect to such information, and we assume no liability resulting from its use. Users should make their own investigations to determine the suitability of the product for their particular purpose and to determine if such product is suitable for their particular purpose. ScienceLab.com can be liable for any claims, losses, or damages of any kind, direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, exemplary, or punitive, however arising, even if ScienceLab.com has been advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">p. 6</p>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 16: Other Information (Continuation)</h2>
  <p>Health: <span data-field="health_rating">{{ health_rating }}</span></p>
  <p>Flammability: <span data-field="flammability_rating">{{ flammability_rating }}</span></p>
  <p>Reactivity: <span data-field="reactivity_rating">{{ reactivity_rating }}</span></p>
  <p>Specific hazard: <span data-field="specific_hazard">{{ specific_hazard }}</span></p>
  <p>Protective Equipment: <span data-field="protective_equipment">{{ protective_equipment }}</span></p>

  <h2 class="section-heading">Section 16: Other Information (Continuation)</h2>
  <p>References: <span data-field="references_2">{{ references_2 }}</span></p>
  <p>Other Special Considerations: <span data-field="other_considerations_2">{{ other_considerations_2 }}</span></p>
  <p>Created: <span data-field="created_date_2">{{ created_date_2 }}</span></p>
  <p>Last Updated: <span data-field="last_updated_date_2">{{ last_updated_date_2 }}</span></p>
</div>

</body>
</html>